    "KerNotch can show and control what %@ is playing.": {
      "comment": "Activities pane, Apple Events row: shown once permission is granted. Placeholder is the player name.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch can show and control what %@ is playing."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch, %@ uygulamasında çalanı gösterebilir ve denetleyebilir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch kann anzeigen und steuern, was %@ gerade abspielt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch puede mostrar y controlar lo que %@ está reproduciendo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch peut afficher et contrôler ce que %@ lit."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch può mostrare e controllare ciò che %@ sta riproducendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch could not write this file for you. Copy the text below into %@ to finish setup.": {
      "comment": "Manual setup sheet subtitle. Placeholder is the absolute path of the agent's configuration file.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch could not write this file for you. Copy the text below into %@ to finish setup."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch bu dosyayı sizin için yazamadı. Kurulumu tamamlamak için aşağıdaki metni %@ dosyasına kopyalayın."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch konnte diese Datei nicht für dich schreiben. Kopiere den Text unten in %@, um die Einrichtung abzuschließen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch no pudo escribir este archivo por ti. Copia el texto de abajo en %@ para terminar la configuración."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch n'a pas pu écrire ce fichier pour vous. Copiez le texte ci-dessous dans %@ pour terminer la configuration."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch non è riuscito a scrivere questo file per te. Copia il testo qui sotto in %@ per completare la configurazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch will ask macOS for permission to control %@, so the notch can show what is playing and its buttons can control playback. Nothing is sent anywhere; KerNotch only talks to %@ on this Mac.": {
      "comment": "Activities pane, Apple Events row: the explanation shown before the macOS prompt. Placeholders are the player name.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch will ask macOS for permission to control %1$@, so the notch can show what is playing and its buttons can control playback. Nothing is sent anywhere; KerNotch only talks to %2$@ on this Mac."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch, %1$@ uygulamasını denetlemek için macOS'ten izin isteyecek; böylece çentik çalanı gösterebilir ve düğmeleri çalmayı denetleyebilir. Hiçbir yere veri gönderilmez; KerNotch yalnızca bu Mac'teki %2$@ uygulamasıyla konuşur."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch fragt macOS um Erlaubnis, %1$@ zu steuern, damit die Notch anzeigen kann, was läuft, und ihre Tasten die Wiedergabe steuern können. Es wird nichts irgendwohin gesendet; KerNotch spricht nur mit %2$@ auf diesem Mac."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch pedirá permiso a macOS para controlar %1$@, de modo que la muesca pueda mostrar lo que suena y sus botones controlen la reproducción. No se envía nada a ningún sitio; KerNotch solo habla con %2$@ en este Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch va demander à macOS l'autorisation de contrôler %1$@, afin que l'encoche puisse afficher ce qui est lu et que ses boutons contrôlent la lecture. Rien n'est envoyé nulle part ; KerNotch communique uniquement avec %2$@ sur ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch chiederà a macOS l'autorizzazione per controllare %1$@, così il notch può mostrare cosa è in riproduzione e i suoi pulsanti possono controllarla. Nulla viene inviato altrove; KerNotch parla solo con %2$@ su questo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now playing, from Apple Music, Spotify, and system media.": {
      "comment": "Activities pane: why the music switch exists.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
